{"id":13,"date":"2023-10-16T07:08:42","date_gmt":"2023-10-16T07:08:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/creas.in\/blog\/?p=13"},"modified":"2025-12-31T09:33:42","modified_gmt":"2025-12-31T09:33:42","slug":"will-tummy-tuck-work-for-me","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/creascosmeticsurgery.com\/blog\/will-tummy-tuck-work-for-me\/","title":{"rendered":"Will tummy tuck work for me?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Tummy tuck (or abdominoplasty ) is a procedure that is gaining popularity amongst most women nowadays. It is intended to get rid of the long-lasting bellies that don\u2019t go after pregnancies for women.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The aim here is to achieve a nice tone and shaped tummy. While liposuction helps in getting rid of the excess fat, it does not help in removing excess lose hanging skin and the helpless weak tummy muscles. This is a condition called Recti divarication.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Recti muscles are a pair of muscles in front of the tummy, these are the six-pack muscles. For women, the muscles are stretched during the pregnancy resulting in a weak central core of muscles. This is largely responsible for the tummy that looks pregnant again!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are advantages of this tummy tuck procedure?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list bullet2\">\n<li>It helps in getting rid of the long-standing and resistant tummy that doesn\u2019t go away with any sort of exercise, or Zumba classes.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Corrects the Recti divarcarion.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>By doing so it helps in getting the tone of the abdomen and strengthening the core muscles. Which can not be achieved by any other means. Be it an exercise regime or even a so-called tightening non-invasive procedure.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The results are evident immediately. As you throw away these unwanted skin and fat tissue.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The lose hanging skin just below your belly button is removed in one go.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>It can also used to correct any hernia present at the time of surgery.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>You can get back the shape and tone that you had before your pregnancy, which is a huge confidence booster for many women.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">I am the right candidate for this tummy tuck?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Anyone desiring to have a good-toned and shaped tummy can be the candidate provided you are in good shape of health. Tummy tuck is not weight loss, you will have to be in the ideal BMI range of your weight.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>A tummy tuck is useful for people who are suffering from lose hanging skin, especially at the lower abdomen, excess fat on the hips, weak Recti muscles, and deep umbilicus.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Most importantly you should be able to follow all the post-operative instructions of Dr C. Senthilkumar.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Whether can I get away with liposuction alone?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>It depends on your fat deposits and your expectations from the liposuction surgery. As liposuction removes only the unwanted fats the loose skin and the muscles will not be corrected. So it is best to consult our consultant Dr C.Senthilkumar who will be able to guide you through the best option that will suit your needs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Book your appointment with creas cosmetic center.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Creas Cosmetic Center is present in Coimbatore. It is one of the leading centers which are designed exclusively for cosmetic surgeries. Our Consultant Dr C. Senthilkumar is A national and internationally board certified Cosmetic and plastic surgeon, trained in the UK.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want to know more\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.creas.in\/contact.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Contact us<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Tummy tuck (or abdominoplasty ) is a procedure that is gaining popularity amongst most women nowadays.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":14,"comment_status":"open","ping_statu